{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁתָה","hw":"שְׁתָה","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁתָה</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. drink (</strong>𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁתָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אִשְׁתִּי</span>, Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܶܫܬܻܝ</span>; v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, שָׁתָה\" href=\"/BDB,_שָׁתָה\", dir=\"rtl\"> ׃שָׁתָה</a><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Pf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">אִשְׁתִּיו</span> (K<sup>§ 11, 4, α)</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:3\" href=\"/Daniel.5.3\">Dn 5:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:4\" href=\"/Daniel.5.4\">4</a>; Impf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְׁתּוֹן</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:2\" href=\"/Daniel.5.2\">2</a>; Pt. act. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁתֵה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:1\" href=\"/Daniel.5.1\">1</a>, pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁתַ֫יִן</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:23\" href=\"/Daniel.5.23\">23</a>;—<em>drink</em>, acc. wine <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:1\" href=\"/Daniel.5.1\">Dn 5:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:4\" href=\"/Daniel.5.4\">4</a>, + ב of vessel v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:23\" href=\"/Daniel.5.23\">23</a> and (acc. om.) v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:2\" href=\"/Daniel.5.2\">2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:3\" href=\"/Daniel.5.3\">3</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, מִשְׁתֵּי","prev":"BDB Aramaic, שֵׁת²"}